[00:19.60]1. In this year of goodwill
[00:22.18]by our God, all need to hear
[00:29.16]That the day of his anger
[00:31.62]will come, and it is near.
[00:38.04](Chorus)
[00:38.50]It means their life, but not just theirs;
[00:43.30]It means our own life as well.
[00:47.98]It means their life if they obey,
[00:52.58]So all the nations we must tell;
[00:57.10]We must tell.
[01:02.52]2. There’s a message to preach,
[01:05.40]so we spread it all abroad.
[01:05.92]We invite all to come and
[01:05.92]be reconciled to God.
[01:25.99](Chorus)
[01:26.49]It means their life, but not just theirs;
[01:30.73]It means our own life as well.
[01:35.79]It means their life if they obey,
[01:40.59]So all the nations we must tell;
[01:45.15]We must tell.
[01:47.87](Bridge)
[01:53.03]It’s urgent, it’s important,
[01:53.77]That people listen, learn, and live.
[01:53.81]We tell them, and we teach them;
[01:53.81]Life-giving truth we freely give.
[02:30.95](Chorus)
[02:31.27]It means their life, but not just theirs;
[02:36.09]It means our own life as well.
